# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Odyssey Y1 — .gitignore
# Tracked: 03_Odyssey_Book/ (.tex sources), 04_Odyssey_Poster/, .vscode/
# Excluded: agent / AI infrastructure, all textbooks & reference PDFs, all PDFs
# (compiled outputs and paired textbook excerpts), LaTeX build artefacts,
# macOS noise.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Agent / AI infrastructure (local-only, not part of the project deliverable)
AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
agent_sessions/
.continue/

# Textbooks and reference material (third-party copyrighted PDFs)
01_Core_Textbooks/
02_Reference_Textbooks/

# All PDFs everywhere — paired *_textbook.pdf excerpts are textbook material;
# per-section compiled outputs are regenerable from .tex.
# Exception: the final compiled book (Odyssey_Project.pdf) IS tracked so the
# project deliverable lives in the repo alongside its source.
*.pdf
!03_Odyssey_Book/Odyssey_Project.pdf

# LaTeX build artefacts
build/
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.toc
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.blg
*.lof
*.lot
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

# macOS noise
.DS_Store
._*

# Editor / IDE scratch (project-level .vscode/settings.json + wrapper script
# stay tracked; ignore user-state workspace files)
.vscode/*.code-workspace

# Misc
*.swp
*.swo
*~
